{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52614","headline":"无相颂 · 慧能","name":"无相颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心平何劳持戒，行直何用修禅？\n恩则孝养父母，义则上下相怜。\n让则尊卑和睦，忍则衆恶无喧。\n若能钻木取火，淤泥定生红莲。\n苦口的是良药，逆耳必是忠言。\n改过必生智慧，护短心内非贤。\n日用常行饶益，成道非由施钱。\n菩提只向心觅，何劳向外求玄。\n听说依此修行，天堂只在目前。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}